        "post_date": "2026-10-06T04:40:26.803Z",
        "raw_markdown": "Classic Kaggle lag. If a notebook is published publicly without being explicitly bound to an active competition submission slot, the score stays on the notebook view but won't sync to the live leaderboard. Plus, with the queue totally gridlocked right now, everything's lagging anyway. Definitely a good one to dissect line-by-line while we wait this out!",
        "content": "<p>Classic Kaggle lag. If a notebook is published publicly without being explicitly bound to an active competition submission slot, the score stays on the notebook view but won't sync to the live leaderboard. Plus, with the queue totally gridlocked right now, everything's lagging anyway. Definitely a good one to dissect line-by-line while we wait this out!</p>",
